es N=2(n+1): theta_hat - theta = O_P(N^{-1/2}), and sqrt(n+1)(theta_hat - theta) = sqrt(N/2)(theta_hat - theta) converges in law to N(0, sigma^2), with sigma^2 = E_obs[(psi(O;eta)-theta)^2]. The sample variance over I_2, centered at theta_hat, converges in probability to sigma^2. Restricting to even N is forced by the equal-half split. (5) Residuals. The binder ch is never used. hSeparation and hGapWitness overlap, as do hFinite and hFiniteReduction. Neither changes the claim. The first conjunct of StructuralZeroThreshold restates the pinned S0 assignment of the recovery algorithm (pin-4); I did not open recoverLevelsAt to confirm it holds by definition. If it does not, it would be an extra restriction on the sample, and F3 should check this when proving."}],"assumption_verdicts":[],"substrate_gates":[],"escalate":null}

